            example:
              "Open Chrome DevTools with F12 or Ctrl + Shift + I on Windows.\n\nconsole.log(\"User data:\", user);\n\nUse the Console to inspect logs, the Network tab to investigate failed API requests, and breakpoints to find where unexpected values appear. Avoid logging passwords, tokens, or other sensitive data.",
