            example:
              "For a production PostgreSQL database:\n\n1. Configure automated backups.\n2. Retain backups according to business requirements.\n3. Restrict access and encrypt backups where appropriate.\n4. Keep protected copies separate from the production environment.\n5. Periodically restore a backup into a test environment.\n6. Measure how long restoration takes and verify data integrity.\n\nA backup that has never been tested may not be recoverable when needed.",
