            example:
              "If a deployed API returns HTTP 500 errors:\n\n1. Check application logs and the error timestamp.\n2. Inspect service health and recent deployments.\n3. Verify required environment variables without exposing their values.\n4. Check database connectivity and resource usage.\n5. Reproduce the issue safely in a test environment.\n6. Apply and verify a fix, or roll back if necessary.\n7. Document the cause and prevention steps.",
