            question: "What Is Software?",
            answer: "Software is a collection of programs, instructions, and related data that tells a computer or digital device what to do. Unlike hardware, which consists of physical components, software is the set of instructions that makes those components useful. Software can perform tasks such as calculations, communication, data storage, and entertainment.",
