          { id: 10, question: "How Do You Choose the Right Data Structure?", answer: "Choose based on the operations needed, data size, memory use, ordering requirements, and expected performance.", example: "Use a queue for tasks processed in arrival order and a hash map for key-based lookup.", image: "", video: "", example_image: "" }
